{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ou3dKWDW121793657293.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>克里姆林宮證實，俄中兩國元首會在深圳會晤。</p><p></p><p>俄羅斯總統新聞秘書佩斯科夫在周二證實，俄方正籌備總統普京本月18日到深圳出席亞太經合組織峰會期間，將會晤國家主席習近平，聚焦討論雙邊關係。佩斯科夫強調，俄方熱切期待兩國元首會晤。</p><p></p><p>習近平早前表示，兩國樹立大國關係典範，要全力鞏固和維護合作大局。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T22:40:39.606001+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T22:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T00:58:20.246778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T22:38:14.336534+00:00","content_hash":"9e73db66780ecc83a217d93ede09cbb5df8cd44b1f98ab6f06f4434ee0155192","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T22:40:39.606001+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}